  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training &amp; Capacity Building for Journalists in ODA-Approved Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICIJ&#x2019;s project seeks to develop capacity of journalists in developing countries to produce stories and engage in investigative journalism that improve transparency and information regarding financial secrecy and justice (tax, corruption and illicit financial flows).</narrative>
  </description>
